      <title>苹果提前两个月发布2026款Mac mini和Studio，AI需求直接推高销量</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260901/%E8%8B%B9%E6%9E%9C%E6%8F%90%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%88%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%832026%E6%AC%BEMac-mini%E5%92%8CStudioAI%E9%9C%80%E6%B1%82%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8E%A8%E9%AB%98%E9%94%80%E9%87%8F/</link>
